WEBVTT

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:06.350
Every human has bestial instincts 
that remain inside them.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.320
I shall call those out, and bring 
them to the surface.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:15.850
Now, awaken! The berserker power 
that lies in Yuya Sakaki's heart!

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.770
Release that power. And rampage.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:26.830
My...

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:27.770
My...

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:28.810
My...

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.840
My...

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.530
...turn!

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.550
D-Wheels.

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.720
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.440
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:43.930
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:46.070
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:24.920
Lightning Strike!

00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:39.040
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's monster effect.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.740
I use one Overlay Unit...

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:43.750
...to halve the attack points

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:48.210
of all your monsters on the field, 
Level 5 or below, until the end of my turn.

00:02:49.030 --> 00:02:54.300
And those lost attack points are added to 
those of Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.860
Treason Discharge!

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:06.590
In other words, the attack points of 
Crow's Raikiri are reduced to 1300,

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.490
and the attack points of Yuya's Dark 
Rebellion increase to 3800...

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.780
A difference of 2500!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.930
Right now, Crow's life is 2400!

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:19.710
If this goes through, Yuya wins in one hit!

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.270
I didn't realize he was so strong.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:26.590
It's hard to believe he's the same person 
who made those hippos dance.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.560
Of course, the guy working 
with the Tops will win!

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:34.010
The future of the Commons is bleak!

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:39.290
I won't let it happen.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:43.050
I activate my Continuous Trap 
Black Feather Cursed Guard!

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:48.670
I negate Dark Rebellion's 
monster effect on Raikiri!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.140
Such pointless struggles.

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:55.880
It seems I shall need to help him a bit.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.320
Where are the Action Cards?

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:01.890
There's an Action Card at course point TD6.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.860
See that Yuya gets it.

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:08.520
This is bizarre...

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.230
What is Yuya doing?

00:04:11.080 --> 00:04:13.700
Xiangke Magician's pendulum effect!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.530
Once per turn,

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:21.040
I can make an Xyz Monster's level 
equal to that monster's rank!

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:28.730
I set Rank 4 Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon to Level 4!

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:34.850
What's he doing now?

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.820
I activate Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum Effect.

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:44.730
Once per turn, I can set the level of one 
monster to equal that of another monster.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:51.420
I set Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's level to 7,

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:54.810
just like Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.630
Two Level 7 monsters?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.040
Does he plan to Xyz Summon?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:03.750
Is he going to summon that monster 
I saw when I fought Yuya before?

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:09.420
Changing from LK3 to TD6.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.970
A little present to you.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.940
Do accept it, Yuya Sakaki.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.910
I overlay...

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.610
...Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon...

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.220
...and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.790
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:46.960
exterminate your enemies with your black wrath!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.660
Xyz Summon!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:51.450
Appear, Rank 7...

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:55.550
...dragon with shining eyes of fury!

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:56.610
Odd-Eyes...

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:58.220
...Rebellion Dragon!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.250
Why did you stop?!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.020
The tremendous shockwave from outside

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.720
seems to have destroyed the 
course-changing circuit!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.440
The backup circuit was destroyed, too.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.630
I can't bring it back on-line now.

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:33.000
When Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon is a component 
for Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon,

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.810
I can destroy all monsters on your 
side of the field, Level 7 or below,

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:40.860
and deal their attack points as damage to you!

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.780
Overlord Howling!

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:47.820
I activate Continuous Trap Black Feather 
Cursed Guard's other effect!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:54.010
I reduce Raikiri's attack points by 400, and its 
level by 1, to negate its destruction.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.480
Crow protects Raikiri from destruction!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.990
He's staved off so many potentially 
fatal attacks by Yuya!

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:03.720
How will this duel end?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:07.440
Th-There's no road!

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:10.910
Th-Those two are gonna fall...

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.850
Don't underestimate the Blackbird!

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:28.260
I won't fall that easily!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:31.660
Fly, Blackbird!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.370
He flew!

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:41.010
What about Yuya?

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:49.190
I activate Equip Spell Supreme 
Wing from my hand.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:53.120
I equip it to Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon.

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.770
Yuya's flying, too!

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:05.030
Wow! That's true entertainment!

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.100
Looking good, Yuya!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.000
Crow's doing well, too.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.740
Why did the course-change stop halfway?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:17.050
I thought Yuya was working with the Tops,

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.250
but that endangered him, as well as me.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.330
Hey, where are you going?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.800
Gongenzaka told us to lay low.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.790
But Yuya...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:50.170
This bracelet always lights up when 
something is happening with Yuya.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:53.010
Which means he might be in trouble again!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:55.290
What a mysterious bracelet.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:58.710
But how are you going to get there?

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:00.100
I don't know.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.580
I don't know, but...

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.040
That's right.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:07.230
Everyone in this room are people that old 
man Tokumatsu chose as trustworthy.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.460
But the minute we leave this room, 
the guards will catch us.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:13.430
You should trust Sora and wait.

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:16.400
But...

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:24.340
At this rate, it's like we're 
asking security to find us.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:29.490
Enough... Just leave me here.

00:09:29.490 --> 00:09:31.040
What are you saying?

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.220
I promise I'll save you, Serena!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.720
Layra is at his stamina's limits, as well.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.820
We cannot go farther, then?

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:44.650
Director, the shockwave earlier

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:48.170
also caused a malfunction in the control 
system for Yuya Sakaki's helmet!

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.000
What?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:52.970
Are you saying we cannot give 
him any more electric shocks?

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.080
No, it's the opposite.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:58.440
The electricity setting is on maximum, 
and we can't stop it!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:01.600
If the electricity keeps flowing,

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.420
he could lose his mind or memory!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:09.520
It could even kill him!

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.720
Yuya...

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:14.430
Answer me, Yuya.

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.510
What happened to you, exactly?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:20.870
When we started, you asked me 
for help. What happened to that?

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:27.020
I use one Overlay Unit

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:30.130
to activate Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon's effect.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:33.540
It can attack as many times as I 
destroyed monsters in this turn.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:37.780
This turn, he destroyed three 
Blackwing Tokens!

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:41.150
Thus, I can attack three times.

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.020
Go, Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:44.960
Attack...

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:45.960
...Raikiri...

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.340
...the Rain Shower!

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:51.530
Wrath of Rebellion... Strike Disobey!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.400
I activate Black Feather Cursed Guard's effect.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:56.830
I negate Raikiri's destruction!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.300
But you still take the damage.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:05.280
Black Feather Cursed Guard's effect

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:09.700
reduces Raikiri's attack points 
by 400, and its level by 1!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.640
He managed to endure it!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:15.100
But Yuya still has two more attacks.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:17.490
Can Crow endure them all?

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:20.200
The maximum electric current is still going.

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.970
If this keeps up, Yuya Sakaki will...

00:11:22.970 --> 00:11:25.400
If he dies, he dies.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:31.170
It would be a shame to no longer 
have him as my pawn...

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:35.870
But right now, Yuya has more 
than met my expectations.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:40.280
Look. The attention of everyone in 
the Duel Palace, and across City,

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:42.480
is focused on him.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:49.090
My second attack.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.030
Do it, Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.260
Attack Raikiri the Rain Shower.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.200
I activate Black Feather Cursed Guard's effect.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.730
I negate Raikiri's destruction!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.610
He managed to endure it,

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:14.510
but Raikiri's attack points decrease by 
400, and its level goes down by 1!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.120
Yuya, what's going on?

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:19.480
This duel isn't like you.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.100
Now, then... I believe it is time.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:34.300
Attention, all security squadrons around 
the Administrative Council building.

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.770
Enter the building at once.

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:40.500
Take control of both Reiji Akaba and the Council.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:46.100
Also take Yuzu Hiiragi and Serena, whom we 
believe to be with them, into custody.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:53.880
It seems he's about to make his move.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:57.900
Even if security comes after us again...

00:12:57.900 --> 00:13:01.600
...you will protect us, won't you?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:04.860
We're counting on you. Right, chairman?

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:06.330
Yes.

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:11.300
It's very reassuring to have a 
duelist of your caliber here.

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:20.060
Yuya probably can't hear anyone right now.

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.750
Even if I did interrupt the duel, what could I do?

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.980
The third attack...

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:27.250
Finish him.

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.610
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:32.720
Wrath of Rebellion... Strike Disobey!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.710
I activate Black Feather Cursed Guard's effect.

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.200
I negate Raikiri's destruction!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:45.480
But Crow's life is down to 400.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:47.370
If this attack lands...

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.840
I activate my trap Black Feather Hope!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.980
I pay half my life, to reduce 
battle damage to 0!

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.720
There we go!

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:03.420
He really is tough.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:07.690
No matter how many times he's crushed, he rises. 
Just as Commons pride themselves on doing!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.380
I now end my turn.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:15.370
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon 
has 3000 attack points.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:21.030
To stop him, I'd have to send out a 
top-class monster from the start.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:22.060
Could I do it?

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.180
Those are...

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.790
Unidentified flying objects sighted 
in the sky above City!

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:45.300
Ten, fifteen... I'm getting twenty readings. 
Putting them on-screen.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.170
The Obelisk Force...

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.860
Academia is coming here now?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:54.260
This is bad.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.310
They must be trying to get 
Yuzu Hiiragi and Serena!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:00.710
Cancel the incursion.

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:05.640
Have the security squadrons 
stand by outside the building,

00:15:05.640 --> 00:15:07.450
and don't let a single person exit!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:12.190
Sergey, fight back against the 
invading Academia army!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.720
In this fierce battle, neither is giving an inch.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.930
Who will ultimately win this duel?

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:22.480
Hey... What are you doing?

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:25.310
I know people want to watch the duel 
from up close, but this is insane!

00:15:25.310 --> 00:15:28.820
The Obelisk Force is the Professor's 
personal strike corps.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.850
They must be after Yuzu and Serena.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.850
You want me to abandon Serena?

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.170
No!

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.950
I told you, she's from Academia 
in the first place!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.520
I'm just taking her back!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.750
To "the prison that is Academia"?

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.920
I won't abandon Serena to a place like that!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:48.490
Or Yuzu!

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:51.630
Tsukikage's taken Yuzu to 
the underground facility.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.980
But what about Serena?

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:57.070
If a higher-up in City is connected to Academia,

00:15:57.070 --> 00:16:00.790
there's no guarantee she was taken 
underground after she lost the duel.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:04.880
Calm down, Melissa. At times like these...

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.480
No! He jumped down!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:11.950
Who the hell are you?

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:15.420
I'm Sora Shiunin. I'm Yuya's friend.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.650
Yuya's?

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:19.320
Yuya isn't currently himself.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:22.730
So I want you to put him 
back in his right mind.

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:25.500
His right mind? What are you...

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.900
The truth is, I wanted to do something.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:33.370
But now, I have to protect Serena from them.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:34.950
Them?

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.280
Hey, are those...

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.020
He said he was Yuya's friend, right?

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:51.490
And he thinks the way Yuya's 
acting isn't normal?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:55.100
Then, I'll get him back in his right mind!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.430
Because I'm Yuya's pal!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.200
My turn!

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.930
This is...

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.900
Drawing this card means

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.740
it's time to go all-in!

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:14.860
I summon my Tuner Monster Blackwing 
— Decay the Ill Wind from my hand!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:25.440
Listen up, Yuya. Decay the Ill Wind 
isn't an ordinary Tuner Monster.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:29.610
When the Synchro Monster I use 
it to summon is destroyed,

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.830
Decay the Ill Wind's effect 
means that I lose the game.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:38.300
In other words, the monster I summon 
with it is my final trump card!

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:44.010
I'm using it to challenge your Odd-Eyes 
Rebellion Dragon to a duel to the death!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:49.710
Level 4 Decay the Ill Wind tunes 
the now Level 4 Raikiri!

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:56.150
Wet your ebony wings, and sound a 
thunderclap in the pouring rain!

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:58.120
Synchro Summon!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:03.080
Pierce through, Assault Blackwing 
— Chidori the Rain Sprinkling!

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.490
Crow brings out his trump card!

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:09.550
But its attack points are only 2600?

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:12.910
I'm not sure how he can have a duel to the death

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.570
with Yuya's 3000-attack-point dragon.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.780
For every Blackwing in my graveyard,

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:23.160
Chidori the Rain Sprinkling's 
attack points increase by 300!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:28.320
There are five Blackwings in 
my graveyard right now.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.410
Thus, its attack points increase by 1500!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:35.690
4100 attack points! That's a big boost!

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:41.870
Battle! Chidori the Rain Sprinkling 
attacks Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:46.680
I'm putting my soul into this battle...

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.900
Wake up, Yuya!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:56.180
Thunderclap Strike Lightning Slash!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:26.280
In that instant, Supreme Wing's effect activates!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:31.250
When the monster equipped with this card is destroyed 
by battle, the victorious monster is destroyed.

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.450
What?

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.920
And it deals the attack points...

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.390
...of the monster it destroyed...

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.860
...to you!

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:10.540
Th-The winner...

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.020
The winner is Yuya!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:18.000
The winner of the semifinals is Yuya Sakaki!

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.140
Yuya...

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.370
What a way to end it!

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.440
I'd assumed Crow had made a big comeback,

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.120
when Yuya hit him with an explosive counter!

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:46.090
The way he is now, he might just 
be able to fight on Jack's level!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.830
A foolish duel.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:59.550
Hey, Yuya! Hey!

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.390
Yuya, can you hear me?

00:21:01.390 --> 00:21:03.740
Yuya! Yuya!

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:07.480
Yuya!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.450
Crow...

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.920
You're back to your senses, Yuya?

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:17.150
Crow? What h-happened?

00:21:17.490 --> 00:21:18.400
Crow!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.620
Listen, Yuya!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:23.470
During the duel, I saw these 
fishy-looking guys appear!

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.100
And apparently, they're after Serena.

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.240
This guy named Sora went to save her...

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.130
You've gotta go, too!

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:32.070
Sora went to save Serena?

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:33.980
You're done talking now, right?

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.270
Crow!

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:39.240
Don't worry about me... Hurry, Yuya!

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.150
Join your allies!

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.340
Crow...

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:44.720
Sorry!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.080
Hey, wait.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.760
You're leaving again?

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:52.390
Get back here, Yuya!

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:58.080
Crow was told about it by Sora.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:00.580
Which means the ones after Serena...

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.400
Has Academia finally appeared 
in this dimension, too?

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:08.360
I'd better find Sora, fast!

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:53.580
Our communicators are jammed within City.

00:23:54.150 --> 00:23:58.850
Once you find the targets, use the 
signal flares to contact us.

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:00.380
Let's begin.

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.320
Is that... The Obelisk Force?

00:24:03.620 --> 00:24:06.240
Is that what Crow was talking about?

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:08.930
Has Academia finally appeared 
in this dimension, too?

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:11.160
I'd better find Sora, fast!

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:16.870
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Raid! Obelisk Force.

00:24:16.870 --> 00:24:18.820
The fun is only getting started!
